@gene('Z169e', 'no free step brings me closer to the goals (a camp or unit is in the way)')
def path_blocked() -> Bool:
    return not any(progress(t) > 0 for t in near(me().pos, 1) - camp_tiles() - ally_tiles() - enemy_tiles())
```

## EDITABLE gene progress (called by cast_v2, path_blocked, score)
